{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/XGwef9yEdWTPR5aQVgYf6Q","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:09.153176+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/XGwef9yEdWTPR5aQVgYf6Q","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/ATpeFH1pdtyl5qwLKpg4iahvI2ice6Qz3IBDuAzxhaibqzwFv8j8n3zMfI5fSmls5icgpzdefJc7icEI9tTWicnicgYyUnLfdPbvCtlkt34047YY9g/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/MVPvEL7Qg0FOqRRvhEBH1memx7lCTCsGExrBGGpiceYKqb1WrbZLHhCQZrAIvPBkgqIPbVIic61u6N2TgibDBWx4g/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>为切实做好我院接收2027年推荐免试攻读研究生（以下简称“推免生”）工作，根据教育部及学校相关管理规定，现将报名工作相关事项通知如下：</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/pMwJhqW452lYIBIATqVoovQpGjL8DEJ9TFaqWzmGibibLkEF4WxkWEnZxUic4MrKxcUcwxxKKdSHVCmiaySevdkW3Q/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>一、申请条件</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/pMwJhqW452lYIBIATqVoovQpGjL8DEJ9TFaqWzmGibibLkEF4WxkWEnZxUic4MrKxcUcwxxKKdSHVCmiaySevdkW3Q/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.拥护中国共产党领导，具有良好的思想品德和政治素质；</span></p><p><span>2.勤奋学习，刻苦钻研，成绩优秀；学术研究兴趣浓厚，具有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力倾向；</span></p><p><span>3.诚实守信，学风端正，无任何考试作弊和剽窃他人学术成果记录；</span></p><p><span>4.品行表现优良，无任何未解除的行政处分；</span></p><p><span>5.具有所在学校硕士研究生推荐免试资格（在教育部研招网推免服务系统完成推免生资格注册）；</span></p><p><span><span>6.身体健康。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/pMwJhqW452lYIBIATqVoovQpGjL8DEJ9TFaqWzmGibibLkEF4WxkWEnZxUic4MrKxcUcwxxKKdSHVCmiaySevdkW3Q/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>二、接收专业及人数</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/pMwJhqW452lYIBIATqVoovQpGjL8DEJ9TFaqWzmGibibLkEF4WxkWEnZxUic4MrKxcUcwxxKKdSHVCmiaySevdkW3Q/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.035102 法律（法学）2人</span></p><p><span>最终确认招生/录取的专业以中国研究生招生信息网“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统”为准（以下简称“全国推免服务系统”，网址：https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm）。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/pMwJhqW452lYIBIATqVoovQpGjL8DEJ9TFaqWzmGibibLkEF4WxkWEnZxUic4MrKxcUcwxxKKdSHVCmiaySevdkW3Q/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>三、申请及录取程序</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/pMwJhqW452lYIBIATqVoovQpGjL8DEJ9TFaqWzmGibibLkEF4WxkWEnZxUic4MrKxcUcwxxKKdSHVCmiaySevdkW3Q/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1. 志愿填报：具有推荐免试资格的考生，在国家规定时间内登录“全国推荐免试攻读研究生信息公开暨管理服务系统”（网址：https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm）查询我院招收推免生章程和专业目录，申请填报我院志愿，接收并确认我院的复试通知；</span></span></p><p><span>2. 复试安排：复试遵循德、智、体、美、劳全面衡量的原则，根据推免生成绩（含本科阶段推免成绩和复试成绩）、结合其一贯学业表现、研究能力和创新潜质、学术道德、思想政治表现及身体健康状况确定拟录取名单。复试内容以综合面试为主，复试形式采取线下，具体要求另行通知；</span></p><p><span>3.我院通过“推免服务系统”向报考我院的推免生发放复试通知， 向拟录取考生发放待录取通知。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/pMwJhqW452lYIBIATqVoovQpGjL8DEJ9TFaqWzmGibibLkEF4WxkWEnZxUic4MrKxcUcwxxKKdSHVCmiaySevdkW3Q/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>四.监督及复议</span><span><br/></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/pMwJhqW452lYIBIATqVoovQpGjL8DEJ9TFaqWzmGibibLkEF4WxkWEnZxUic4MrKxcUcwxxKKdSHVCmiaySevdkW3Q/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.申请材料不实或弄虚作假者，一经查实，取消录取资格；</span></p><p><span>2.入学时未同时取得本科毕业证书和学士学位证书者，取消录取资格；</span></p><p><span>3.推免工作实行回避制度，相关人员有近亲属或利害关系人参加推免招生的须主动申请回避，有非近亲属参加的须主动报备；</span></p><p><span>4.复试工作坚持公正、公平、公开的原则，各工作环节做到有章可循；学校研究生招生工作领导小组对推免工作实行全程监督。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/pMwJhqW452lYIBIATqVoovQpGjL8DEJ9TFaqWzmGibibLkEF4WxkWEnZxUic4MrKxcUcwxxKKdSHVCmiaySevdkW3Q/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>四.咨询方式</span><span><br/></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/pMwJhqW452lYIBIATqVoovQpGjL8DEJ9TFaqWzmGibibLkEF4WxkWEnZxUic4MrKxcUcwxxKKdSHVCmiaySevdkW3Q/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>联系人：曹老师</span></p><p><span>联系电话：15982445134</span></p><p><span>QQ群：1061340654（西华-法学院（知识产权学院）研究生招生交流群）</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ATpeFH1pdtwoZI90SHAL6raG705La74YaQuLgEpcqC5cOfqSibibrMXFg7G5HyWknQusHiaI4qkjlMXT2npUJUORQclDRFWjqHdXrQW6gQHk78/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>END</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/ATpeFH1pdtx3yXIpkS3GjCEYdayibfEfY3o0sRzFyeiaehNGX4lRUAzicX5dibeMGS1ub2L6waQYbCg3seDfeE2ic7lZwTV0v8JJxuL3rYnxQo6A/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>图文：法学院（知识产权学院）</span></p><p><span>编辑：戴正一</span></p><p><span>一审一校：雷卓翌</span></p><p><span>二审二校：王黎黎、范锡林</span></p><p><span>三审三校：肖东华</span></p></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"f5982cc8e377f39dc510d3b64287b584772637b5da16bb5e45ef4c79cf464faf","textLength":978,"sourceSha256":"d306e64bd303e537fbdbbfa788772f56ad9e9faf4b2832ce6cce128329e25cd0","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-55b9cc09e229529bf17e","title":"2026年西华大学法学院（知识产权学院）2027年接收推荐免试攻读硕士研究生的工作通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:09.153176+00:00"}
